message: >-
  If you use MetaVision Studio, please cite it as below, and also cite the
  MetaVision3D and SAMI methods it implements (listed under references).
title: "MetaVision Studio"
abstract: >-
  A napari workbench for 3D spatial metabolomics and multi-omics MALDI
  imaging, built on the MetaVision3D and SAMI methods.
